<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;title-18f75b7a02&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;soi/components/content/v1/title&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-06-26T19:58:28Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Welcome to the Illinois Department of Labor&#34;}}" id="title-18f75b7a02" class="cmp-title ">
    <h1 class="cmp-title__text"> Welcome to the Illinois Department of Labor</h1>
</div>

    

</div>
<div class="spacer aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
    <div class="cmp-spacer"></div>


    

</div>
<div class="text aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0"><div id="text-42436225e6" class="cmp-text ">
    <p>The Illinois Department of Labor is a medium-sized State agency that manages an extra-large workload, serving thousands of employees and businesses in the State each year. IDOL's primary responsibilities are to protect worker wages, welfare and working conditions by enforcing State labor and employment laws, providing compliance assistance to employers, and increasing public awareness of workplace protections. IDOL has offices throughout the State, with main offices in Springfield and Chicago; an office in the State Regional Office Building in Marion; and field staff located throughout the State.</p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="spacer aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
    <div class="cmp-spacer"></div>


    

</div>
